# 换行统一：仓库内一律 LF
# 容器会直接挂载 deploy/ 下的脚本与配置，CRLF 会导致 bad interpreter / 配置解析失败
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
